# Claude Code's per-branch worktrees: full checkouts of other branches. Ignored
# here as well as in `.git/info/exclude` so the entry is shared rather than
# per-machine. `vitest.config.ts` excludes the same path from test collection —
# see the comment there for what leaks in without it.
.claude/worktrees

# Throwaway scripts written while investigating something — a Playwright probe,
# a one-off scanner. `git add -A` will otherwise sweep them into a commit.
.tmp-*

